  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 5'5\" bed of 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Ford f150. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2015-2026 Ford F150 styleside 5'5\" bed\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nPrecisely Fit:\nEach cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 5'6\"\nbed of 2015 2016 2017 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Ford\nf150.\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with\nadjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user\nfriendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly.\nWHY Quad Fold: More access room when folded up, more durable with one\nmore cross bar and two more firm clamps than trifold cover.\nSafety First: Reinforced corner design keeps the cover tight to the\nbed; sturdy clamps and buckles with straps protect the cover from\nsliding or blowing off while driving.\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high\ntemperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is\nlike, we’ve got you covered.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.",
